        ("What is the policy on academic dishonesty?", "Academic dishonesty includes plagiarism, cheating, falsification of data, and unauthorized collaboration. Penalties range from a zero on the assignment to course failure or expulsion. All violations are reported to the academic affairs office and recorded on the student's disciplinary file.", "policies"),
        ("How do I access my student email?", "Your student email is firstname.lastname@university.edu. Access it through the student portal or set it up on your mobile device. Check your email daily for important announcements from the registrar, bursary, and department.", "student-services"),
