        ("How to get disability accommodations", "Register with the disability services office to receive accommodations. Provide documentation of your disability and meet with a coordinator to develop an accommodation plan. Common accommodations include extended time on exams, note-taking assistance, and accessible classroom locations. Notify your instructors at the start of each semester.", "student-services", "How do I get disability accommodations", "disability services, accommodations", "Accessibility, exam accommodations"),
