        ("What are the graduation requirements", "Complete all major and general education requirements, maintain the minimum GPA, complete at least 120 credit hours for undergraduate degrees, and clear all financial and disciplinary holds. Apply for graduation during your final semester. The graduation audit is conducted by the registrar's office.", "graduation", "What are the graduation requirements", "graduation requirements, degree requirements", "Credit hours, graduation audit"),
